     ACTION ITEMS     ACTION ITEMS     ACTION ITEMS

       1. Mr. Tracy will call Mr. Forsely and Mr. Shaw to clarify the joint
          status of IEEE on the ANS committee.  Mr. Zettel also suggested we
          contact his friend Mr. Fred Bolling, who is on the board of ANSI.

       2. Mr. Tracy will get Wil Baden's flowtree font to Dave Harralson, and
          Wil's control flow rationale to Heidi for eventual inclusion in the
          rationale section.



      X3J14/90-010 Draft Minutes, X3J14 Meeting #13, August 21-25, 1990, Page 4       3. The chair will remind everyone that we will be meeting at 8 A.M. at
          the next meeting, as Ford Motor Co., our host, requires that all
          buildings close early.

       4. The Logistics committee will supply the 1991 schedule by the next
          meeting.

       5. The chair will write a letter of thanks to the B.C.I.T. for their help
          and excellent facilities at this meeting.

       6. The chair will submit the revised Statement of Work to X3.


